{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"无。X在S03、S13的感受提示较密，但按音乐段落依次出现，密度没有明显转化为同时阅读的负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事真正需要抓住的关键词，感受文字缩小并按音乐进程出现，让观众可以先抓住人物处境，再逐渐接收具体感受，不必同时消化一整片词语。更重要的是，X把人物心理变化落实到身体反应、音乐织体和具体意象上，舞步、旧歌、摇篮曲等线索反复出现，使怀念、抗拒、孤单、动摇和重新站稳形成连续的发展。Y的叙事也清楚，但右栏不少词语更像并列的情绪标签，音乐变化与人物心理转折之间的对应没有X那么细致。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "643ef482-6b57-4c47-b29a-a91ca7f3adc9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T054351796729Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:45:08.581293+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f7ebd8ea1ecb89392e67e632ed1e150f6530d5bd06a7d57bd16b345bd283a67a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat